 foot upon.\n\nFreyja, the girl who had her village, Ridgerode destroyed, travels with an unknown weapon called the 'AeternoBlade'. Freyja looks to take revenge on Beladim. Her vengeance is aided by Vernia, a mysterious witch. Vernia taught Freya about the potential of the AeternoBlade. Freyja obtained the true power of the AeternoBlade with the advice of \"Bernard\", the man who had been imprisoned in the Everlasting Void. With that, she can travel back in time before Beladim destroyed her village to save it and have her vengeance once and for all.", "summary": "In the region of Awelsia, vengeful Freyja travels with an unknown weapon called 'AeternoBlade'. Freyja looks to take revenge on Beladim, the Lord of the Mist who destroyed her village, Ridgerode, and killed her tribe. Her vengeance is helped by Vernia, who has as much merit as Beladim. Vernia taught Freya about the abilities of AeternoBlade. Freya has to venture into many different world dimensions to discover how to annihilate Beladim.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/aeternoblade", "videos": [{"id": 17962, "name": "PS4 Trailer", "video_id": "ShEy-dJhEPU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ShEy-dJhEPU", "title": "AeternoBlade PS4 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ShEy-dJhEPU/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 3992, "name": "AeternoBlade"}]}